  "created": "2026-10-12T09:41:06.75Z",
  "description": ".NET Android binding for AppDimens Dynamic (io.github.bodenberg:appdimens-dynamic 3.2.0, modular).\n      Targets net8.0-android through net11.0-android. Exposes the core + scaled strategy\n      (DimenSdp / DimenSsp / DimenScaled) under Com.Appdimens.Dynamic.Code, plus every optional\n      scaling module (fluid, fill, power, diagonal, density, fit, resize, units, perimeter,\n      interpolated, percent, auto, logarithmic) as separate bound AARs. Com.Appdimens.Dynamic.DynamicConfig\n      wraps DimenCache warmup / invalidateOnConfigChange for configuration-change refresh.\n      Jetpack Compose helpers are not practical from C# — see README.",
  "id": "Bodenberg.AppDimens.Dynamic",
