  "releaseNotes": "NuGet 3.6.1: Embedded modular AARs Maven io.github.bodenberg:appdimens-dynamic* 3.2.0\n      (core+scaled + 13 strategy modules); multi-target net8.0-android / net9.0-android /\n      net10.0-android / net11.0-android; DynamicConfig helper for warmup and configuration-change\n      dimension refresh; AndroidX/Kotlin pins aligned to AAR POM.\n      Android library: https://github.com/bodenberg/appdimens-dynamic · Binding: https://github.com/bodenberg/appdimens-net-binding",
